@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title UC02 办理图书借出顺序图
actor "图书管理员" as A
boundary LendUI as UI
control LendController as C
entity BorrowRecord as Loan
entity BookCopy as Copy
entity ReservationSlip as Slip
A -> UI : queryPending()
UI -> C : getPending()
C -> Loan : queryPending()
Loan --> C : 待借出记录列表
C --> UI : 列表
UI --> A : 展示列表
A -> UI : confirmLend(borrowId, copyId)
UI -> C : confirmLend(borrowId, copyId)
C -> Loan : get(borrowId)
Loan --> C : loan 或 null
C -> Copy : get(copyId)
Copy --> C : copy 或 null
alt 记录待借出 且复本匹配且 RESERVED
 note over A,UI : 管理员核对实物及读者并确认交付
 group 原子事务 T2
  C -> Copy : markOnLoan(copyId)
  C -> Loan : markOnLoan(borrowId, lentAt)
  opt 借阅记录关联预约单
   C -> Slip : markFulfilled(slipId)
  end
 end
 C --> UI : 借出成功
else 不存在或状态不合法或复本不匹配
 C --> UI : 拒绝办理，不改变馆藏与记录
end
UI --> A : 展示结果
note over C,Copy : 借出仅 RESERVED -> ON_LOAN，不再次扣减可用数量
@enduml
